Running locally
Clone the repo and open `index.html` directly in a browser:
```
git clone https://github.com/RazeMpho/<repo-name>.git
cd <repo-name>
open index.html
```
(No server or build process required.)
Deployment
This site can be hosted for free with GitHub Pages:
Push this repo to GitHub with the site file renamed to `index.html`.
Go to your repo's Settings → Pages.
Under "Source," select your main branch and `/ (root)`.
Save — GitHub will publish it at `https://razempho.github.io/<repo-name>/` within a minute or two.
